request.description:
Returns a public commercial-bank asset from the embedded asset catalogue.

Method: GET
Path: /v1/assets/banks/ng/{bank_asset}
Path variable: bank_asset={{bank_asset}}
Authentication: public endpoint.

Retrieve one health facility by its stable lowercase public ID.

Method: GET
Path: /v1/healthcare/health-facilities/{facility_id}

Path variable: facility_id={{healthFacilityId}}

Expected responses: 200, 400, 404, 500
